# A_g of Figure 6, produced by `greta cfg2ta test/grammars/running-example.cfg`.
states decl expr ident stmt
finals stmt
terminals ELSE EQ IDENT IF INT LPAREN PLUS RPAREN SEMI STAR THEN TINT
trans decl 3 TINT 4 T:TINT S:ident T:EQ S:expr
trans expr 5 PLUS 3 S:expr T:PLUS S:expr
trans expr 6 STAR 3 S:expr T:STAR S:expr
trans expr 7 INT 1 T:INT
trans expr 8 LPAREN 3 T:LPAREN S:expr T:RPAREN
trans expr 9 - 1 S:ident
trans ident 4 IDENT 1 T:IDENT
trans stmt 0 SEMI 2 S:decl T:SEMI
trans stmt 1 IF 4 T:IF S:expr T:THEN S:stmt
trans stmt 2 IF 6 T:IF S:expr T:THEN S:stmt T:ELSE S:stmt
